<!--Q#11-->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para>How does the line described as “parallel to the \(x\)-axis and passing through \((3, 4)\)” relate to the \(y\)-axis? Will it always, sometimes, or never be perpendicular to it?
      </para><newline/></problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para>Always perpendicular.</para>
  </solution></exercise>
